{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":6,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician; on stringed instruments, upon the eight-stringed lyre. A Psalm by David."},{"n":1,"text":"LORD, don’t rebuke me in your anger, neither discipline me in your wrath.","tok":[{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[0]},{"t":", don’t rebuke "},{"t":"me","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"in","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" anger, neither discipline "},{"t":"me","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"in","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" wrath."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Have mercy on me, LORD, for I am faint. LORD, heal me, for my bones are troubled.","tok":[{"t":"Have","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"mercy","s":["H3068"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"on","s":["H3068"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"me","s":["H3256"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"for","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"I","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"am","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" faint. "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"]},{"t":", heal "},{"t":"me","s":["H3256"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"for","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" bones "},{"t":"are","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" troubled."}]},{"n":3,"text":"My soul is also in great anguish. But you, LORD—how long?","tok":[{"t":"My","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":" soul "},{"t":"is","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"also","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"in","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" great anguish. "},{"t":"But","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"you","s":["H3588"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"]},{"t":"—"},{"t":"how","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" long?"}]},{"n":4,"text":"Return, LORD. Deliver my soul, and save me for your loving kindness’ sake.","tok":[{"t":"Return, "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":". Deliver "},{"t":"my","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[3]},{"t":", "},{"t":"and","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"save","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"me","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"for","s":["H5704"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H3